 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Light Constructs</em></p>\n<p>You can interpose light between yourself and an attacking enemy when you sense killing intent. As a reaction for 2 cursed energy when you are attacked by a creature within 30 feet of you that you can see, you impose disadvantage on the attack roll with a flare of light. An attacker that can't be blinded is immune to this feature. At 6th level, the target also takes 2d8 radiant damage or 4d8 at 11th level.</p>",
